                <start-time>00:07:10,779</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:14,662</end-time>
                <translation>对于人类而言无可置疑的、确实的东西</translation>
                <original>人間にとって疑うことのできない確実なものを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="125" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:07:14,662</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:16,580</end-time>
                <translation>便是西田试图探寻的</translation>
                <original>西田は突き止めようとします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="126" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:07:18,916</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:24,702</end-time>
                <translation>他认为 那必须是现实本来的样子</translation>
                <original>それは現実そのままのものでなければならない と考え</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="127" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:07:24,702</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:28,678</end-time>
                <translation>在主客观分离之前的
自分の主観と客観が分かれる前の</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="128" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:07:28,678</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:31,840</end-time>
                <translation>纯粹经验这一概念
純粋経験という概念に至ります</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="129" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:07:33,882</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:37,203</end-time>
                <translation>我们在认识杯中水的时候</translation>
                <original>我々はコップに入った水を認識するとき</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="130" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:07:37,203</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:40,420</end-time>
                <translation>会依据各种信息</translation>
                <original>さまざまな情報をもとにします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="131" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:07:40,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:43,120</end-time>
                <translation>然而 在这样的瞬间</translation>
                <original>しかしこのような瞬間は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="132" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:07:47,173</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:49,625</end-time>
                <translation>我们既不清楚发生了什么</translation>
                <original>まだ何が起こったかもわからず</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="133" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:07:49,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:51,380</end-time>
                <translation>甚至没有思考的余地</translation>
                <original>考える余裕さえありません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="134" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:07:53,716</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:59,060</end-time>
                <translation>西田认为 这样的经验才是纯粹经验</translation>
                <original>こうした経験こそが純粋経験だと 西田は考えたのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="135" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:08:02,690</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:05,282</end-time>
