                <start-time>00:09:12,533</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:14,544</end-time>
                <translation>并不是自己的事</translation>
                <original>自分のことじゃないんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="159" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:14,544</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:15,360</end-time>
                <translation>这个世界
この世界</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="160" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:15,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:18,612</end-time>
                <translation>这个世界究竟呈现何种面貌</translation>
                <original>この世がどういう姿をしているのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="161" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:18,612</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:21,227</end-time>
                <translation>正是去探求这一点</translation>
                <original>それを探求していくことこそが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="162" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:21,227</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:24,863</end-time>
                <translation>才是通往遇见真正自我的道路</translation>
                <original>本当の自分に出会う道なんだということなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="163" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:27,647</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:30,293</end-time>
                <translation>虽然明白但还是很难过啊</translation>
                <original>分かっちゃいるけど悲しいんだよとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="164" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:30,293</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:33,387</end-time>
                <translation>或者说 道理懂了</translation>
                <original>なんかその理屈は分かったか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="165" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:33,387</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:36,574</end-time>
                <translation>-但这种难以释怀的感觉是怎么回事　-对的</translation>
                <original>-なんだこのモヤモヤはみたいなことを　-そうなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="166" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:36,574</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:38,941</end-time>
                <translation>不 并不是说因为道理如此</translation>
                <original>いやいや理屈でこうなんだから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="167" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:38,941</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:41,416</end-time>
                <translation>就让你强行接受 不是这样的</translation>
                <original>飲み込めよっていうのでは違いますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="168" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:41,416</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:43,690</end-time>
                <translation>不是的 正是你刚才说的那种难以形容的感觉</translation>
                <original>違います今おっしゃったそのモヤモヤですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="169" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:43,690</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:46,583</end-time>
                <translation>绝不轻易放开它</translation>
                <original>それを決して手放さないということです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="170" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:46,583</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:49,355</end-time>
                <translation>因此 不要仅仅依靠能够言说的事情</translation>
                <original>ですので言葉にできることだけで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="171" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:09:49,355</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:50,480</end-time>
