            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="221" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:11:51,246</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:54,804</end-time>
                <translation>第三编是“善” 第四编是“宗教”
第3編が善、第4編が宗教</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="222" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:11:54,804</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:00,033</end-time>
                <translation>不过 西田写作的顺序其实是这样的</translation>
                <original>ただし西田が書いた順番はこうだったんですね</original>
                <spell/>
