            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="238" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:12:47,847</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:48,563</end-time>
                <translation>嗯</translation>
                <original>はい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="239" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:12:49,337</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:51,302</end-time>
                <translation>诶—— 从下面开始？</translation>
                <original>えー下から</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="240" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:12:51,302</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:51,920</end-time>
                <translation>从结尾开始？</translation>
                <original>終わりから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="241" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:12:51,920</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:53,623</end-time>
                <translation>从结尾开始读更好吗？</translation>
                <original>終わりから読んだ方がいいんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="242" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:12:53,623</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:55,278</end-time>
                <translation>感觉有点像《星球大战》</translation>
                <original>なんかスターウォーズみたい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="243" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:12:55,278</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:56,733</end-time>
                <translation>确实呢</translation>
                <original>本当ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="244" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:12:56,733</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:00,786</end-time>
                <translation>《星球大战》就是从原作的某部开始拍成电影的</translation>
                <original>スターウォーズは原作の何番目かから映画化されてるんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="245" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:00,786</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:02,565</end-time>
                <translation>按《星球大战》狂热粉的话</translation>
                <original>スターウォーズマニアに言わせると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="246" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:02,565</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:05,100</end-time>
                <translation>他们会说按这个顺序看最容易懂</translation>
                <original>この順番で見るのが一番わかりやすいですよみたいな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="247" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:05,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:06,480</end-time>
                <translation>这本书则是从后往前看最好</translation>
                <original>これ後ろから一番</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="248" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:06,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:06,860</end-time>
                <translation>是的</translation>
                <original>そうなんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="249" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:06,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:07,949</end-time>
                <translation>4、3、2、1</translation>
                <original>4,3,2,1</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="250" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:07,949</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:09,094</end-time>
                <translation>西田他啊</translation>
                <original>西田はですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="251" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:09,094</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:12,899</end-time>
                <translation>并不是在完全理解后才写这本书的</translation>
                <original>分かっててこの本を書いてるんじゃないんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="252" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:12,899</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:15,529</end-time>
                <translation>而是一边写一边逐渐理解</translation>
                <original>書きながら分かっていくんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="253" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:15,529</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:16,690</end-time>
                <translation>理解得越来越深</translation>
                <original>どんどん分かっていく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="254" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:16,690</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:18,831</end-time>
                <translation>因此 我们目睹的正是西田</translation>
                <original>ですのでもう西田がこう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="255" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:18,831</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:21,486</end-time>
                <translation>不断深挖的样子</translation>
                <original>穴を掘っていく姿を我々は目撃するわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="256" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:22,893</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:26,142</end-time>
                <translation>而且他是个精力极其充沛的人</translation>
                <original>で大変な体力のある人ですから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="257" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:26,142</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:29,515</end-time>
                <translation>我们最好还是从坑已经挖得差不多的地方</translation>
                <original>私たちはやっぱりちょっと穴が掘り上がったところから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="258" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:29,515</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:31,402</end-time>
                <translation>在某种程度上看到完成形态之后</translation>
                <original>完成をある程度見てから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="259" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:31,402</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:34,496</end-time>
                <translation>再开始着手会比较好</translation>
                <original>から少し始めた方が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="260" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:34,496</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:37,183</end-time>
                <translation>要我们去重走他这条路</translation>
                <original>もうこの道を我々がたどるなんてのはもう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="261" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:37,183</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:38,256</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得还是放弃为好</translation>
                <original>ちょっとやめた方がいいと思うんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="262" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:13:39,741</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:43,153</end-time>
                <translation>那么 我们先从第四编“宗教”开始读吧</translation>
                <original>ではまずは第4編の宗教から読んでいきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="263" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:45,118</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:47,426</end-time>
                <translation>宗教的要求</translation>
                <original>宗教的要求は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="264" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:47,426</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:50,184</end-time>
                <translation>是对自我的要求</translation>
                <original>自己に対する要求である</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="265" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:50,184</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:54,237</end-time>
                <translation>是对自我生命的要求</translation>
                <original>自己の生命についての要求である</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="266" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:54,237</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:00,147</end-time>
                <translation>我们并非为了自我的安心 而寻求宗教</translation>
                <original>我々は自己の安心のために 宗教を求めるのではない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="267" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:14:00,147</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:05,479</end-time>
                <translation>安心不过是宗教带来的结果
安心は宗教より来る結果に過ぎない</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="268" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:14:05,479</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:10,843</end-time>
                <translation>宗教的要求是我们欲罢不能的</translation>
                <original>宗教的要求は我々のやまんと欲してやむあたわざる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="269" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:14:10,843</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:14,244</end-time>
                <translation>伟大生命的要求</translation>
                <original>大なる生命の要求である</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="270" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:14:14,244</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:17,216</end-time>
                <translation>是严肃意志的要求
厳粛なる意志の要求である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="271" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:14:19,876</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:22,094</end-time>
                <translation>宗教的要求</translation>
                <original>宗教的要求とは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="272" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:14:22,094</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:25,397</end-time>
                <translation>即是我们生命本身的要求</translation>
                <original>我々の生そのものの要求であると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="273" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:14:25,397</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:27,139</end-time>
                <translation>西田如此思考</translation>
                <original>西田は考えました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="274" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:14:29,233</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:32,211</end-time>
                <translation>并且 在那里 知性的作用</translation>
                <original>そしてそこには知の働き</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="275" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:14:32,211</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:34,787</end-time>
                <translation>与爱的作用是无法分开来写的</translation>
                <original>と愛の働きを書くことができません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="276" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:14:38,188</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:40,191</end-time>
                <translation>知与爱</translation>
                <original>知と愛とは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="277" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:14:40,191</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:46,863</end-time>
                <translation>通常被认为是完全相异的精神作用</translation>
                <original>普通には全然相異なった精神作用であると考えられている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="278" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:14:46,863</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:53,165</end-time>
                <translation>然而 关键在于 这两种精神作用绝非不同种类</translation>
                <original>しかし要はこの2つの精神作用は決して別種のものではなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="279" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:14:53,165</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:57,962</end-time>
                <translation>我认为它们原本是同一的精神作用
本来同一の精神作用であると考える</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="280" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:14:57,962</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:02,802</end-time>
                <translation>那么 这是怎样一种精神作用呢？</translation>
                <original>しからばいかなる精神作用であるか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="281" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:15:02,802</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:08,057</end-time>
                <translation>一言以蔽之 就是主客合一的作用
一言にて言えば主客合一の作用である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="282" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:15:08,057</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:11,100</end-time>
                <translation>是使事物与我自身相一致的作用</translation>
                <original>我が物に一致する作用である</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="283" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:13,607</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:16,720</end-time>
                <translation>“知”与“爱”这两种活动</translation>
                <original>知ると愛するという営みは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="284" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:16,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:20,040</end-time>
                <translation>乍看似乎是不同的精神作用</translation>
                <original>一見すると異なる精神作用のようです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="285" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:22,818</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:27,594</end-time>
                <translation>但是 西田并不这么认为</translation>
                <original>しかし西田はそうではないと考えました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="286" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:27,594</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:31,126</end-time>
                <translation>他认为 这些都是主客合一的作用 
それらは主客合一の作用</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="287" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:31,126</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:35,094</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 当自己与对象试图合为一体时</translation>
                <original>つまり自分と対象が一つになろうとするとき</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="288" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:35,094</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:39,586</end-time>
                <translation>两者便会一同开始运作</translation>
                <original>共に動き始めるものだというのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="289" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:39,586</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:43,445</end-time>
                <translation>如果没有这种主客合一的作用</translation>
                <original>もし主客合一の作用がなければ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="290" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:43,445</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:46,712</end-time>
                <translation>我们即便看到美丽的绘画</translation>
                <original>私たちは美しい絵画を見て</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="291" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:46,712</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:49,223</end-time>
                <translation>或是听到音乐</translation>
                <original>あるいは音楽を聴いても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="292" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:49,223</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:52,189</end-time>
                <translation>也不会感动</translation>
                <original>感動することはありません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="293" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:52,189</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:54,347</end-time>
                <translation>看到他人悲伤的身影 
悲しむ他者の姿を見て</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="294" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:54,347</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:57,313</end-time>
                <translation>也不会流下眼泪</translation>
                <original>涙を流すこともありません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="295" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:15:57,313</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:59,565</end-time>
                <translation>当我与他人合一时 
私が他者に一致する</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="296" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:02,508</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:06,820</end-time>
                <translation>西田说 爱便在此刻发挥作用</translation>
                <original>そのとき愛が働くと西田は言うのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="297" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:16:09,894</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:13,099</end-time>
                <translation>我们爱花</translation>
                <original>我々が花を愛するのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="298" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:16:13,099</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:17,024</end-time>
                <translation>是因为自己与花合为一体</translation>
                <original>自分が花と一致するのである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="299" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:16:17,024</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:23,303</end-time>
                <translation>爱月 是因为与月合为一体</translation>
                <original>月を愛するのは月に一致するのである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="300" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:16:23,303</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:28,297</end-time>
                <translation>如此 知与爱是同一的精神作用</translation>
                <original>斯くのごとく知と愛とは同一の精神作用である</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="301" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:30,346</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:32,600</end-time>
                <translation>首先 西田是这样说的</translation>
                <original>まずこのように西田が言っていました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="302" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:32,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:33,791</end-time>
                <translation>关于“知与爱”</translation>
                <original>知と愛について</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="303" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:33,791</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:36,386</end-time>
                <translation>若松老师 拆开揉碎了该怎么理解呢？</translation>
                <original>これは若松さん噛み砕くとどういうことでしょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="304" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:36,386</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:39,984</end-time>
                <translation>首先 这是说“知”与“爱”本是同一种东西</translation>
                <original>まず知と愛というのは一つのものなんだというわけなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="305" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:39,984</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:42,640</end-time>
                <translation>比如说 我们想要去了解某个人对吧</translation>
                <original>例えば私たちはこれを知ろうとしますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="306" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:42,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:46,160</end-time>
                <translation>但是 即使试图去了解 无论多么了解那个人</translation>
                <original>でも知ろうとしどんなにその人のことを知っても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="307" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:46,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:49,599</end-time>
                <translation>也不一定能爱上那个人呢</translation>
                <original>その人のことを愛せるとは限らないですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="308" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:49,599</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:53,400</end-time>
                <translation>而我们会觉得爱的力量 即使完全不了解</translation>
                <original>で愛の力というのは全く知らなくても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="309" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:53,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:56,184</end-time>
                <translation>也存在爱上那个人的情况</translation>
                <original>その人を愛することってあるんだと思うんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="310" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:56,184</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:59,629</end-time>
                <translation>西田说 这两者都是必要的</translation>
                <original>その両方が必要だって西田が言うわけなんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="311" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:16:59,629</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:00,981</end-time>
                <translation>只有一方是不行的</translation>
                <original>片方だけではダメだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="312" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:00,981</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:02,442</end-time>
                <translation>只有爱也不行</translation>
                <original>愛だけでもダメ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="313" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:02,442</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:04,055</end-time>
                <translation>只有知也不行</translation>
                <original>知だけでもダメ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="314" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:04,055</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:08,046</end-time>
                <translation>在知与爱结合的地方 才会发生些什么</translation>
                <original>知と愛が結びついたところに何かが起こるんだって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="315" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:08,046</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:10,100</end-time>
                <translation>对于“知”的理解</translation>
                <original>知に対する理解って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="316" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:10,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:15,808</end-time>
                <translation>是指那种道理和本能之类的吗？</translation>
                <original>その理屈と本能とか そういうことですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="317" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:15,808</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:17,180</end-time>
                <translation>简单来说的话</translation>
                <original>わかりやすく言いますと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="318" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:17,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:19,733</end-time>
                <translation>“知”的力量就是语言的力量</translation>
                <original>知の力ってのはやっぱり言葉の力だと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="319" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:19,733</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:20,409</end-time>
                <translation>语言
言葉</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="320" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:20,409</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:24,966</end-time>
                <translation>我们试图通过语言去认识事物的力量</translation>
                <original>私たちが言葉によって認識していこうとする力</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="321" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:24,966</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:27,975</end-time>
                <translation>而“爱”的力量 我认为终究是超越语言的</translation>
                <original>で愛の力はやっぱり言葉を超えていくんだと思うんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="322" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:27,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:30,417</end-time>
                <translation>试图用语言去理解</translation>
                <original>言葉で理解しようとするってことは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="323" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:30,417</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:32,357</end-time>
                <translation>也就是试图用道理去理解对吧</translation>
                <original>理屈で理解しようってことですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="324" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:32,357</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:34,167</end-time>
                <translation>那是非常重要的力量</translation>
                <original>それはとっても大事な力なんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="325" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:34,167</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:36,000</end-time>
                <translation>但是 超越道理</translation>
                <original>でも理屈を超えて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="326" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:36,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:38,638</end-time>
                <translation>去认识事物的力量也非常重要</translation>
                <original>ものを認識していく力もとても大事なんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="327" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:39,989</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:43,826</end-time>
                <translation>但其实 我们每天在各种地方都在实践着这一点</translation>
                <original>でも私たちはそれ実は日々いろんなところでやってるんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="328" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:43,826</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:45,464</end-time>
                <translation>工作的现场</translation>
                <original>仕事の現場ってのはもう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="329" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:45,464</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:48,994</end-time>
                <translation>如果没有知与爱就无法成立</translation>
                <original>知と愛がなければ成り立たないわけなんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="330" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:48,994</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:51,719</end-time>
                <translation>西田并不是在说什么特别的事情</translation>
                <original>西田は別に特別なことを言ってるわけではなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="331" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:51,719</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:53,878</end-time>
                <translation>而是我们每天都在实践的事情</translation>
                <original>私たちが日々実践していることを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="332" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:53,878</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:57,236</end-time>
                <translation>特意用语言表达出来 就是这样一回事</translation>
                <original>あえて言葉で言うとこうなるんだっていうことなんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="333" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:17:57,236</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:00,332</end-time>
                <translation>因此 比如说“与物合一”这件事</translation>
                <original>ですので例えば我が物に一致するって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="334" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:00,332</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:03,037</end-time>
                <translation>所谓“物” 或许可以试着换成“工作”来理解</translation>
                <original>物っていうのは仕事に変えてみるといいかもしれませんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="335" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:04,061</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:07,070</end-time>
                <translation>是一种我与工作合而为一的状态</translation>
                <original>私と仕事が一つになるような状態なんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="336" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:07,070</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:10,406</end-time>
                <translation>这样一想 就很有日本特色了吧</translation>
                <original>でそう考えると日本的ですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="337" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:10,406</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:14,460</end-time>
                <translation>对于工匠来说 工作即人生</translation>
                <original>職人における仕事ってそれが人生だし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="338" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:14,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:19,302</end-time>
                <translation>对自己制作的东西所怀有的那种爱意</translation>
                <original>作っているものに対する愛情みたいなものと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="339" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:19,302</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:25,232</end-time>
                <translation>正因如此才能实现的精巧设计</translation>
                <original>そのだからこそできる緻密な仕掛けなり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="340" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:25,232</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:28,220</end-time>
                <translation>或是制作方式和成果 本就是一体</translation>
                <original>仕様なんていうものは一体だから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="341" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:28,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:32,253</end-time>
                <translation>在这一点上 是非常日式的理解呢</translation>
                <original>これに関してはとても日本的理解ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="342" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:32,253</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:34,700</end-time>
                <translation>是啊 就是这种难以形容的部分</translation>
                <original>そうですねいわく言い難いですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="343" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:34,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:36,200</end-time>
                <translation>虽然难以形容</translation>
                <original>いわく言い難いんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="344" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:36,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:38,060</end-time>
                <translation>但却是我们正在实践的事情</translation>
                <original>私たちが実践していること</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="345" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:38,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:40,583</end-time>
                <translation>啊 原来如此</translation>
                <original>ああなるほど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="346" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:40,583</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:43,744</end-time>
                <translation>嗯 所谓“爱”归根结底</translation>
                <original>まあ愛するっていうことはやっぱり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="347" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:43,744</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:47,887</end-time>
                <translation>让他者变得比自己更重要吧 终归</translation>
                <original>自分よりも大事になってくるってことですよねやっぱり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="348" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:47,887</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:50,329</end-time>
                <translation>因此 觉得那个人的痛苦</translation>
                <original>ですのでその人の苦しみは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="349" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:50,329</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:54,537</end-time>
                <translation>超越了我自身的痛苦 有这样感受的人呢</translation>
                <original>私の苦しみを超えるなんてことは人はあるんじゃないでしょうかね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="350" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:54,537</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:56,040</end-time>
                <translation>当那个人的笑容</translation>
                <original>その人が笑うことが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="351" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:56,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:58,222</end-time>
                <translation>变成了我的快乐时</translation>
                <original>俺の楽しいことだってなってくると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="352" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:18:58,222</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:02,103</end-time>
                <translation>此刻想要让那个人开心的行为</translation>
                <original>今その人を喜ばそうとしていることは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="353" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:02,103</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:03,717</end-time>
                <translation>也就是想要让自己开心的行为</translation>
                <original>自分を喜ばそうとしていることであって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="354" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:03,717</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:04,676</end-time>
                <translation>正是如此</translation>
                <original>まさにそうです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="355" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:04,676</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:06,520</end-time>
                <translation>所谓“为了那个人而做”</translation>
                <original>その人のためにやってるのって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="356" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:06,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:07,540</end-time>
                <translation>其实也并非完全如此</translation>
                <original>そういうことでもないんだよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="357" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:07,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:10,000</end-time>
                <translation>兜兜转转也是为了我自己啊</translation>
                <original>回り回って俺のためでもあるんだよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="358" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:10,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:11,500</end-time>
                <translation>类似这样的感觉 我稍微能理解</translation>
                <original>みたいなところはちょっと分かります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="359" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:11,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:13,136</end-time>
                <translation>正是如此呢</translation>
                <original>まさにそれですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="360" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:13,136</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:15,426</end-time>
                <translation>因此 我们其实可以从“自我”这个出发点</translation>
                <original>ですので私がっていうところから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="361" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:15,426</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:19,132</end-time>
                <translation>稍微抽离出来 去思考世界</translation>
                <original>少し私たちは離れて世界を考えることができるんです実は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="362" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:19,132</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:23,210</end-time>
                <translation>而西田 正是试图将我们引领到那个角度</translation>
                <original>で西田は私たちはそこに連れて行こうとするんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="363" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:23,210</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:26,480</end-time>
                <translation>那么接下来 为何会产生这样的思想呢？</translation>
                <original>では続いてなぜこのような思想が生まれたのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="364" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:26,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:29,160</end-time>
                <translation>让我们从西田的人生来探寻其背景吧</translation>
                <original>その背景を西田の人生から見ていきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="365" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:35,377</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:42,003</end-time>
                <translation>“思索着世界。大海真是个不可思议的存在啊。”</translation>
                <original>「世界のことを考えている。海というものは不思議だ」</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="366" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:43,899</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:48,743</end-time>
                <translation>喜欢眺望大海的西田几多郎</translation>
                <original>海を眺めるのが好きだったという西田幾多郎</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="367" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:51,032</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:53,425</end-time>
                <translation>明治维新两年后
明治維新から2年後</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="368" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:53,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:57,851</end-time>
                <translation>他出生于石川县宇之气的一个名门望族</translation>
                <original>石川県の宇ノ気の由緒ある家に生まれました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="369" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:19:59,355</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:05,445</end-time>
                <translation>西田在他的前半生接连遭遇苦难
西田はその前半生で次々と苦難に見舞われます</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="370" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:05,445</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:11,462</end-time>
                <translation>亲人相继离世 父亲事业失败
相次ぐ肉親の死父親の事業の失敗</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="371" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:11,462</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:16,761</end-time>
                <translation>不久西田家便家道中落
やがて西田家の没落</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="372" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:16,761</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:21,601</end-time>
                <translation>从高中退学的西田无法以正规的方式进入大学
高校を退学した西田は大学に正規入学できず</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="373" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:21,601</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:25,831</end-time>
                <translation>大学时代作为专科生遭受各种歧视
大学時代は専科生として様々な差別に遭い</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="374" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:25,831</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:28,500</end-time>
                <translation>被视为人生的失败者</translation>
                <original>人生の落伍者のような目に遭います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="375" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:32,708</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:35,382</end-time>
                <translation>毕业后也求职无门</translation>
                <original>卒業後は就職もままならず</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="376" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:35,382</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:38,718</end-time>
                <translation>好不容易成为中学教师的西田</translation>
                <original>ようやく中学の教師となった西田は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="377" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:38,718</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:43,340</end-time>
                <translation>在几度面临失业的窘境中
幾度も失職の浮き目に遭う中で</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="378" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:43,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:46,200</end-time>
                <translation>在禅寺热心地坐禅
禅寺で座禅を熱心に組みます</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="379" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:48,445</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:50,536</end-time>
                <translation>作为其思索的结晶</translation>
                <original>その思索の結晶として</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="380" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:50,536</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:53,414</end-time>
                <translation>后来便诞生了《善的研究》</translation>
                <original>後に善の研究が生まれたのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="381" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:20:55,965</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:59,192</end-time>
                <translation>哲学是从我们自身的
哲学は我々の自己の</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="382" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:20:59,192</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:03,487</end-time>
                <translation>自我矛盾这一事实开始的</translation>
                <original>自己矛盾の事実より始まるのである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="383" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:21:03,487</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:07,586</end-time>
                <translation>哲学的动机不是“惊讶”</translation>
                <original>哲学の動機は「驚き」でなくして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="384" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:21:07,586</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:11,752</end-time>
                <translation>而必须是深沉的人生悲哀</translation>
                <original>深い人生の悲哀でなければならない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="385" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:15,502</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:17,137</end-time>
                <translation>不知道是不是我理解有些怪</translation>
                <original>自分の解釈が変わっているのかな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="386" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:17,137</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:21,716</end-time>
                <translation>哲学的动机必须是深沉的人生悲哀</translation>
                <original>哲学の動機は深い人生の悲哀でなければならない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="387" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:21,716</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:23,620</end-time>
                <translation>这句话让我稍微打起了精神</translation>
                <original>ちょっと僕に元気が出る言葉です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="388" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:23,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:26,585</end-time>
                <translation>现在非常痛苦的人或许</translation>
                <original>今すごい辛い人とかがもしかしたら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="389" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:26,585</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:28,388</end-time>
                <translation>能以此勉励自己</translation>
                <original>頑張れるかみたいな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="390" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:28,388</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:31,590</end-time>
                <translation>大概一直觉得“不应该是这样的”吧</translation>
                <original>多分こんなはずじゃないはずなんだよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="391" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:31,590</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:34,188</end-time>
                <translation>他一定是一直这么想的吧</translation>
                <original>ってずっと思ってたんでしょうねきっと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="392" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:34,188</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:36,063</end-time>
                <translation>觉得不合理的感觉</translation>
                <original>理屈に合わないという気持ちです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="393" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:36,063</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:38,963</end-time>
                <translation>不合道理啊 这到底是怎么回事</translation>
                <original>理屈に合わないよどういうことだよの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="394" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:38,963</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:42,669</end-time>
                <translation>那么 要怎样做才合乎道理呢？</translation>
                <original>じゃあどうすると理屈に合うのかなっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="395" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:42,669</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:45,540</end-time>
                <translation>他出生在一个动荡的时代呢</translation>
                <original>時代的には激動の頃に生まれていますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="396" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:45,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:46,638</end-time>
                <translation>是呢</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="397" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:46,638</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:49,408</end-time>
                <translation>这个时代本身 果然是一个试图将人</translation>
                <original>この時代そのものというのはやっぱり人を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="398" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:49,408</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:51,380</end-time>
                <translation>嵌入某种框架的时代</translation>
                <original>ある型にはめようとした時代でもある</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="399" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:51,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:53,288</end-time>
                <translation>那就是所谓的近代化</translation>
                <original>それが近代化だったんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="400" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:53,288</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:56,341</end-time>
                <translation>也就是所谓的西洋模式</translation>
                <original>それはいわゆる西洋型という型なんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="401" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:56,341</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:59,640</end-time>
                <translation>而西田对此强烈地反抗</translation>
                <original>で西田はそれに強く反発する</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="402" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:59,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:02,598</end-time>
                <translation>因此 他在学校里也过得不顺利</translation>
                <original>ですので学校もうまくいかない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="403" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:02,598</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:05,215</end-time>
                <translation>即使当了老师 也曾经被迫辞职</translation>
                <original>になっても辞めさせられちゃったりもする</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="404" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:05,215</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:08,943</end-time>
                <translation>从这个意义上说 可以认为他是一个脱离了框架的人</translation>
                <original>そういう意味では枠からはみ出した人だったって言っていいと思うんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="405" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:08,943</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:11,520</end-time>
                <translation>不过 难道现在没有遭遇类似处境的人吗？</translation>
                <original>でもちょっと似たような目にあってる人いるんじゃないのかな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="406" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:11,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:14,918</end-time>
                <translation>总觉得 日本不断地走向全球化</translation>
                <original>なんか日本がどんどんグローバル社会になっていって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="407" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:14,918</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:18,668</end-time>
                <translation>尽管我们一直被告知会变成一个非常自由美好的社会</translation>
                <original>すごい自由でいい世の中になっていくって聞かされてた割には</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="408" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:18,668</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:21,764</end-time>
                <translation>但我这日复一日干涸的生活又是怎么回事呢？</translation>
                <original>なんだ俺の日々のこの乾いた暮らしはっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="409" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:21,764</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:23,967</end-time>
                <translation>你指出的这点非常重要
ご指摘は大変重要で</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="410" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:23,967</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:27,479</end-time>
                <translation>我之所以现在想和大家一起解读这本书</translation>
                <original>僕はやっぱりこの本を今皆さんと読み取ってみたい一つの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="411" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:27,479</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:29,112</end-time>
                <translation>一个非常重要的理由就是</translation>
                <original>大変大きな理由はですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="412" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:29,112</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:31,783</end-time>
                <translation>正是在那里 或许存在着</translation>
                <original>そこにこそ次の時代を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="413" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:31,783</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:34,020</end-time>
                <translation>创造下一个时代的东西</translation>
                <original>作っていく何かがあるんじゃないだろうかってことなんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="414" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:34,020</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:34,934</end-time>
                <translation>原来如此</translation>
                <original>なるほど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="415" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:34,934</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:37,055</end-time>
                <translation>所以 对于那些掌握了大量词汇</translation>
                <original>ですのでたくさん言葉ができて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="416" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:37,055</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:39,560</end-time>
                <translation>了解了大量知识 却</translation>
                <original>たくさんものを知っていてっていうのに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="417" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:39,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:42,894</end-time>
                <translation>感到有些违和的人们</translation>
                <original>少し違和感を感じている人たちこそが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="418" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:42,894</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:44,637</end-time>
                <translation>正如西田所做的那样</translation>
                <original>西田がやってくれたように</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="419" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:44,637</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:48,180</end-time>
                <translation>或者说 正是背负着我们这种巨大苦难的人们</translation>
                <original>あるいは私たちのこういう大きな苦難を背負っている人こそが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="420" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:48,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:51,440</end-time>
                <translation>或许才能创造出我们的下一个时代</translation>
                <original>私たちの次の時代を作っていけるんじゃないだろうかってことを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="421" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:51,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:55,626</end-time>
                <translation>我想分四次和大家一起思考一下这个问题</translation>
                <original>ちょっと皆さんと4回にわたって考えてみたいなと思っているんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="422" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:55,626</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:58,377</end-time>
                <translation>我们从最后面的第四编开始 
一番後ろの第4編から</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="423" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:58,377</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:01,622</end-time>
                <translation>读到了现在 感觉怎么样呢？</translation>
                <original>今回読んできましたけどもいかがだったでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="424" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:01,622</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:04,130</end-time>
                <translation>怎么说呢 一点点地对</translation>
                <original>少しずつその何でしょうね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="425" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:04,130</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:06,184</end-time>
                <translation>知与爱 还有</translation>
                <original>知と愛それから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="426" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:06,184</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:09,254</end-time>
                <translation>自己的事 与物</translation>
                <original>自分のことともの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="427" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:09,254</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:11,160</end-time>
                <translation>自己之外与自己
自分以外と自分</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="428" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:11,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:14,726</end-time>
                <translation>如果不了解所有关于自己的事</translation>
                <original>自分みたいなことを全部知らないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="429" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:14,726</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:17,452</end-time>
                <translation>就无法抵达真实 像这样的事</translation>
                <original>真実にたどり着かないみたいなことは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="430" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:17,452</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:20,112</end-time>
                <translation>我稍微明白了这是主题</translation>
                <original>テーマであるということは少し分かってきたから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="431" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:20,112</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:22,634</end-time>
                <translation>我们一听到要读哲学书</translation>
                <original>私たちは何か哲学書を読もうと思うと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="432" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:22,634</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:24,800</end-time>
                <translation>就会觉得里面是不是有着我们要的答案</translation>
                <original>何か答えがあるんじゃないかそこに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="433" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:24,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:26,545</end-time>
                <translation>但西田并不是那样的人</translation>
                <original>西田はそういう人ではないんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="434" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:26,545</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:29,750</end-time>
                <translation>他是只留下问题的人</translation>
                <original>この人は問いだけを残していった人なんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="435" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:29,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:33,111</end-time>
                <translation>因此 如果我们试图从西田的这本书中</translation>
                <original>ですので私たちは西田のこの書物から</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" id="" index="436" vertical="0" torder="1" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:33,111</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:35,160</end-time>
                <translation>寻求某种解答</translation>
                <original>何か解決を求めようとすると</original>
